===========================================================================
3. OpenCV
===========================================================================
Version:   4.12.0
Licence:   Apache License 2.0
Copyright: Copyright (C) OpenCV Foundation

Used only as the dependency of the WeChat QRCode engine. The modules exercised
are exactly those that opencv_contrib's wechat_qrcode module declares:
core, imgproc, objdetect, dnn. No other OpenCV module or general-purpose OpenCV
API is called anywhere in this project.

On Android the OpenCV Java bindings and the prebuilt libopencv_java4.so are
consumed as published Maven artifacts
(com.github.jenly1314.WeChatQRCode:opencv and :opencv-armv64). On iOS a minimal
opencv2.xcframework is built from source by scripts/build_opencv_ios.sh with
BUILD_LIST limited to those same modules.

